xtras/9044e8c467c55890aa952a92fd19916f.poster.avif?t=1771364117\" width=780 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754370/extras/9044e8c467c55890aa952a92fd19916f.webm?t=1771364117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754370/extras/9044e8c467c55890aa952a92fd19916f.mp4?t=1771364117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bespoke, Powerful Bosses:</strong> A boss is not just a particularly powerful monster. Every boss is confronted at the end of a dedicated level, full of unique challenges reflecting their might. They range from tweaking the underlying gameplay slightly to completely upending gameplay you're used to, forcing your monsters to adapt - or die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Settlement System:</strong> Hope is not yet completely snuffed out, as some human settlements still exist, strongholds of humanity against the encroaching Abyss. Your base of operations can be upgraded with materials brought back from each expedition, upgrading buildings to enhance their functionality or unlock new ways to tackle the Abyssal threat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Pavel Auseitasau"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754370/07c9811c55e1463e1f7d5b18c8f941b778dbd16d/header.jpg?t=1771364117","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Pavel Auseitasau & Freedom Games - All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2754370/1057299677/4e658524fd4c23194cc93b20747b71315f2f0cb4/1750819619/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748879914","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2754370/105729967